          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅删除本机登录凭据、目录与缓存；服务器上的音乐、歌单和收藏不会被删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only local login credentials, library data, and caches are removed; music, playlists, and favorites on the server are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅刪除本機登錄憑證、目錄與快取；伺服器上的音樂、歌單和收藏不會被刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在打开歌曲信息、歌曲鉴赏等需要公开音乐资料的功能时按需查询。不会上传音频文件、歌词、播放地址、NAS 密码或完整音乐库。查询结果默认缓存 14 天。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queries only run on demand when you open features that need public music data, such as song info and song appreciation. Audio files, lyrics, stream URLs, NAS passwords, or your full library are never uploaded. Results are cached for 14 days by default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅在打開歌曲資訊、歌曲鑑賞等需要公開音樂資料的功能時按需查詢。不會上傳音訊檔案、歌詞、播放地址、NAS 密碼或完整音樂庫。查詢結果預設快取 14 天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅重置首页模块的显示与排序，不会删除任何歌曲、缓存或播放记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only resets the Home modules display and order. No songs, caches, or playback records will be deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅重置首頁模塊的顯示與排序，不會刪除任何歌曲、快取或播放記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从备份恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore from Backup"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
