    },
    "只删除这台 Mac 上的离线文件，不会删除音乐服务器上的歌曲。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only deletes offline files on this Mac; songs on the music server are not removed."
