    "各来源含义不同，评分、评论数和收听量不会合并为综合分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each source has a different meaning; ratings, review counts, and listen counts are not combined into a single score."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各來源含義不同，評分、評論數和收聽量不會合併為綜合分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
