    "基本信息": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basic Information"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基本信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填写内网地址及可选外网地址后，Auralis 会同时探测两端；内网 30 秒内可达则优先使用，内网不可达才降级外网。外网请填写完整的 http:// 或 https:// 地址；HTTPS 更安全，HTTP 会明文传输调用 Token。Agent 会通过插件搜索并下载到 NAS 音乐目录（仅下载，不刮削/整理）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After entering a LAN address and an optional WAN address, Auralis probes both; the LAN is preferred when reachable within 30 seconds, falling back to the WAN only when unreachable. Use a full http:// or https:// URL for the WAN; HTTPS is safer since HTTP sends your call token in plain text. The agent searches and downloads via plugins into your NAS music directory (download only, no scraping/organizing)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填寫內網地址及可選外網地址後，Auralis 會同時探測两端；內網 30 秒內可達則優先使用，內網不可達才降級外網。外網請填寫完整的 http:// 或 https:// 地址；HTTPS 更安全，HTTP 會明文傳輸調用 Token。Agent 會通過外掛搜尋併下載到 NAS 音樂目錄（僅下載，不刮削/整理）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份与恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup & Restore"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份與還原"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份内容：App 设置、音乐服务器（含登录凭据）、大模型接口、音乐下载插件（含 Token）。不包含本地数据库、歌曲、专辑、歌单、收藏、播放记录、缓存或下载文件。备份文件使用密码加密，请妥善保管密码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup includes: App settings, music servers (with login credentials), model endpoints, and music download plugins (including tokens). It does not include your local database, songs, albums, playlists, favorites, playback history, cache, or downloaded files. The backup file is encrypted with a password — keep the password safe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "備份內容：App 設定、音樂伺服器（含登錄憑證）、大模型接口、音樂下載外掛（含 Token）。不包含本地數據庫、歌曲、專輯、歌單、收藏、播放記錄、快取或下載檔案。備份檔案使用密碼加密，請妥善保管密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份密码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup Password"
          }
