    "支持 OpenAI Chat Completions、OpenAI Responses API，\n以及 DeepSeek、通义千问、Kimi、Ollama、LM Studio\n和兼容 OpenAI 协议的中转服务。\nAPI Key 仅保存于系统 Keychain。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports OpenAI Chat Completions, the OpenAI Responses API,\nplus DeepSeek, Qwen, Kimi, Ollama, LM Studio,\nand OpenAI-protocol-compatible relay services.\nYour API Key is stored only in the system Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支援 OpenAI Chat Completions、OpenAI Responses API，\n以及 DeepSeek、通義千問、Kimi、Ollama、LM Studio\n和兼容 OpenAI 協議的中轉服務。\nAPI Key 僅儲存於系統 Keychain。"
