    "默认关闭 ReplayGain。启用后优先使用服务器返回的真实 Track/Album Gain；缺少标签时不做普通音量归一化。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ReplayGain is off by default. When enabled, the real Track/Album Gain returned by the server is preferred; no generic volume normalization is applied when tags are missing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設關閉 ReplayGain。啟用後優先使用伺服器返回的真实 Track/Album Gain；缺少標籤時不做普通音量歸一化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认只显示数量摘要，具体信息需手动展开。记忆与技能只存在本机 App Support，不会上传；每次 AI 对话开始时会按需注入相关记忆。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only a count summary is shown by default; details can be expanded manually. Memory and skills live only in local App Support and are never uploaded; relevant memory is injected as needed at the start of each AI conversation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設只顯示數量摘要，具體資訊需手動展開。記憶與技能只存在本機 App Support，不會上傳；每次 AI 对話開始時會按需註入相關記憶。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
